{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"4901037320010","name":"樹里","text":"──で、この日は15時に集合だったよな","trans":"──那，这天是15点集合吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-5","name":"プロデューサー","text":"うん、それで大丈夫だ","trans":"嗯，那样就行","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901037320020","name":"樹里","text":"わかった。これ、今日のレポートな\r\nじゃあ","trans":"知道了。这个，是今天的报告\n那就这样","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-9","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ありがとう、助かるよ\r\n──ん","trans":"谢谢，帮大忙了\n──嗯？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-11","name":"プロデューサー","text":"なんか、分厚い……","trans":"总觉得，挺厚的……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-13","name":"プロデューサー","text":"────あっ、樹里\r\nこれ──……！","trans":"────啊，树里\n这个──……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901037320030","name":"樹里","text":"お腹空いたときに食べてくれ……！","trans":"肚子饿的时候吃吧……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-18","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……うん、ありがとな……！","trans":"……嗯，谢了啊……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}